  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.692308,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Those thinkers who cannot believe in any gods often assert that the love of humanity would be in itself sufficient for them; and so, perhaps, it would, if they had it.",
      "output_sha256": "f65b8452e00eb398f01ad45a3046dae3f8ae882917430f71f3b20d6149647365",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f65b8452e00eb398f01ad45a3046dae3f8ae882917430f71f3b20d6149647365",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "There is a very real thing which may be called the love of humanity; in our time it exists almost entirely among what are called uneducated people; and it does not exist at all among the people who talk about it.",
      "output_sha256": "dc66a8f35a64b88768a4cdb114139485cd6f514778e43cef9ca86aa4beb45c43",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc66a8f35a64b88768a4cdb114139485cd6f514778e43cef9ca86aa4beb45c43",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A positive pleasure in being in the presence of any other human being is chiefly remarkable, for instance, in the masses on Bank Holiday; that is why they are so much nearer Heaven (despite appearances) than any other part of our population.",
      "output_sha256": "9606c54963065d377c812808e8aaa9c255cbe40013f19c590ba26c041770dea7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "9606c54963065d377c812808e8aaa9c255cbe40013f19c590ba26c041770dea7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I remember seeing a crowd of factory girls getting into an empty train at a wayside country station.",
      "output_sha256": "ca65c3aca6f97553d393ae787310021ddc3efc98508b8973ddf8c972725fb5e6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "ca65c3aca6f97553d393ae787310021ddc3efc98508b8973ddf8c972725fb5e6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "About twenty of them chose to crowd into a single carriage, leaving the rest of the train entirely vacant.",
      "output_sha256": "a71abcbff2eab2fe86709aa73898dba8895696af6a8428324c8556f4944c984d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.54589,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "deefbad8908adc0eea15982ca469d290152d61880ea6625c99762bda6518fb84"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a71abcbff2eab2fe86709aa73898dba8895696af6a8428324c8556f4944c984d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is the real love of humanity.",
      "output_sha256": "dd14b00151f118464e7554b35cc4499321dc1a10992f206546e7277ad5d3892a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd14b00151f118464e7554b35cc4499321dc1a10992f206546e7277ad5d3892a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is the definite pleasure in the immediate proximity of one’s own kind.",
      "output_sha256": "d1c5788c9abf94e0d022e4740aabdaf6fa21b17512526cf6d0252a10291e0900",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "d1c5788c9abf94e0d022e4740aabdaf6fa21b17512526cf6d0252a10291e0900",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Only this coarse, rank, real love of men seems to be entirely lacking in those who propose the love of humanity as a substitute for all other love; honourable, rationalistic idealists.",
      "output_sha256": "9418ea04e30e7bdb91d3e200eb8afaba816a86b2366d8e87032b92f2074a9990",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "9418ea04e30e7bdb91d3e200eb8afaba816a86b2366d8e87032b92f2074a9990",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I can well remember the explosion of human joy which marked the sudden starting of that train; all the factory girls who could not find seats (and they must have been the majority) relieving their feelings by jumping up and down.",
      "output_sha256": "787ff28c57537b78210d624b5eaeb8536c2f9e250c44c1f8706d2f78a32182d0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "787ff28c57537b78210d624b5eaeb8536c2f9e250c44c1f8706d2f78a32182d0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Such unrestrained joy is something I have never witnessed among modern philosophers or idealists.",
      "output_sha256": "98958c1abe7d24e62c7355e59b463074c1be1da91df29ad183cae79669022c49",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.332857,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "41a252004809a512197bb47eab00a5fbe3cf87e5d442619c7a2730f6b30226d4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98958c1abe7d24e62c7355e59b463074c1be1da91df29ad183cae79669022c49",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "You wouldn’t catch a group of rational thinkers cramming themselves into a third-class carriage just for the thrill of shared company, nor would you find them bouncing up and down in celebration.",
      "output_sha256": "cebaaddedac2a995e5d6c80aea2df91696a0ee3e3a3dbc70cf9d574fc40311ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.338562,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c26cda4c33d5605d9028b24fa21736c76fed0ba3c9415505870dc890ac102966",
        "b9ac0604fef1d6ccfd10ed2714bb91a19fb091fda9926025bcd63441291ef373"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cebaaddedac2a995e5d6c80aea2df91696a0ee3e3a3dbc70cf9d574fc40311ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Some people express a fear that vulgar trippers will overrun all beautiful places, such as Hampstead or Burnham Beeches.",
      "output_sha256": "c4c125f7689c8daa6e44394313f5bfc7611b23b562a15a399fe0da1d24709c9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "c4c125f7689c8daa6e44394313f5bfc7611b23b562a15a399fe0da1d24709c9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, this fear seems unfounded; tourists tend to favor the company of their own.",
      "output_sha256": "bade68a9d7d94239c3c294e2f8cb3fbad0db236aec79e5f094a486a49ec1136d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.262726,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f16feb85261e0b8d3c5d1c9ae99422ea29c188a1b179565160782a79619f67e4",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "bade68a9d7d94239c3c294e2f8cb3fbad0db236aec79e5f094a486a49ec1136d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "They have a fervent need to gather in groups, reveling in their collective experiences.",
      "output_sha256": "b40c0369bb9a9f8fc49d28a4f0436c525966028c5489314f261abc08f3158c99",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.262726,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f16feb85261e0b8d3c5d1c9ae99422ea29c188a1b179565160782a79619f67e4",
        "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b40c0369bb9a9f8fc49d28a4f0436c525966028c5489314f261abc08f3158c99",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But among the minor and milder aspects of the same principle, I have no hesitation in placing the problem of the colloquial barber.",
      "output_sha256": "0fba4580d8b4be7edddcfbb980b65fdc4b73a27e8c744af1eca4a00f302f950f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fba4580d8b4be7edddcfbb980b65fdc4b73a27e8c744af1eca4a00f302f950f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Before any contemporary figure claims to love humanity genuinely, I contend that he should first demonstrate a genuine pleasure when his barber engages him in conversation.",
      "output_sha256": "125209125dd4afb62fa367aa24de647c148ac9942a6fa09ae6575e9b8d2c15aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.395012,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "91adca85459cc158cb3a0373229d929a5f18a9f80c91fa4aba8977b3d796a0a7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "125209125dd4afb62fa367aa24de647c148ac9942a6fa09ae6575e9b8d2c15aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "His barber is humanity: let him love that.",
      "output_sha256": "ee16c0df4ae449be07fb544d92e1c1f9fb3c56b340708ae765c3994e5e080c82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "ee16c0df4ae449be07fb544d92e1c1f9fb3c56b340708ae765c3994e5e080c82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he is not pleased at this, I will not accept any substitute in the way of interest in the Congo or the future of Japan.",
      "output_sha256": "32ce24ca3485148d5a89e1c807614bcbd051466b5366145f3e8c43001eb02a5f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "32ce24ca3485148d5a89e1c807614bcbd051466b5366145f3e8c43001eb02a5f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "If a person cannot foster affection for the barber—someone he sees regularly—how can he possibly extend that love to those he has never met, such as individuals from Japan?",
      "output_sha256": "a6053a6ae497fc2fac23ac11accbed4c564895519c508f58e8dd670a14257448",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.310489,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "481d7e6bbf6f1b20f3a4c045e5fd12389137f06213ac036709d1fdfc5a99bd73"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a6053a6ae497fc2fac23ac11accbed4c564895519c508f58e8dd670a14257448",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is urged against the barber that he begins by talking about the weather; so do all dukes and diplomatists, only that they talk about it with ostentatious fatigue and indifference, whereas the barber talks about it with an astonishing, nay incredible, freshness of interest.",
      "output_sha256": "3fa233a1b807b6e58019849978474485bd815dd093ee4154c63c2bbd425a51f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "3fa233a1b807b6e58019849978474485bd815dd093ee4154c63c2bbd425a51f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is objected to him that he tells people that they are going bald.",
      "output_sha256": "4c3b78756bcf4a34163c90f0e02f192343e9c516800e26a01ddc49c177bb1e00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "4c3b78756bcf4a34163c90f0e02f192343e9c516800e26a01ddc49c177bb1e00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "That is to say, his very virtues are cast up against him; he is blamed because, being a specialist, he is a sincere specialist, and because, being a tradesman, he is not entirely a slave.",
      "output_sha256": "f5b9387bd687655b2bef29812c1bb7da552378d4e768577f1b30c81626376e0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5b9387bd687655b2bef29812c1bb7da552378d4e768577f1b30c81626376e0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But the only proof of such things is by example; therefore I will prove the excellence of the conversation of barbers by a specific case.",
      "output_sha256": "ff91283dcd1a17701ce21dba832a82da1ae22d15872118529c770632a9ca259d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff91283dcd1a17701ce21dba832a82da1ae22d15872118529c770632a9ca259d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Lest any one should accuse me of attempting to prove it by fictitious means, I beg to say quite seriously that though I forget the exact language employed, the following conversation between me and a human (I trust), living barber really took place a few days ago.",
      "output_sha256": "36fdcc56142342a9ce8038aafdadfd86c2570987e9089f4d6c77e38ba1750323",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "36fdcc56142342a9ce8038aafdadfd86c2570987e9089f4d6c77e38ba1750323",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": ".....",
      "output_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "f85d30e7d95a052f65167f1f1095186d1190c91502b4ab7aedab460a6eab8870",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I had received an invitation to a gathering intended for Colonial Premiers and, in order to avoid any misconceptions about my appearance, I decided to stop at a barber shop in the Strand for a shave.",
      "output_sha256": "4b64d1a532a158d6f67f251c44796f36ab42726e70f3e0489f21246ae34da0a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.375155,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "84902a9a8a7b0fcd7ed3da83e707ddf4d0e80bce8a6279e6c35c3211b923b331"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4b64d1a532a158d6f67f251c44796f36ab42726e70f3e0489f21246ae34da0a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "While enduring the somewhat uncomfortable process, the barber remarked:",
      "output_sha256": "1869a4ca568119be4ca13d353c0d812d2935a50acf1680dbf57e97cd7ec1ee95",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.375909,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6f71f9841559493f91ee745e2fbec80ec3b3d96ccf1f895a028045b4b6fefa83"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1869a4ca568119be4ca13d353c0d812d2935a50acf1680dbf57e97cd7ec1ee95",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“There’s quite a bit of buzz in the papers about this new shaving technique, sir.",
      "output_sha256": "ac0d2895a0a757249683437e07efdb81e375dd5350dfbb4cf470ed6e9eda3c56",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.640977,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9e9efcde5910562131216f5a81bd116e7589baf43cc985ffcf74f57c4f20e5f7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ac0d2895a0a757249683437e07efdb81e375dd5350dfbb4cf470ed6e9eda3c56",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It seems you can shave yourself with anything—with a stick or a stone or a pole or a poker” (here I began for the first time to detect a sarcastic intonation) “or a shovel or a——”",
      "output_sha256": "1e7c335d9351258297a79568c99e1a344cb1cd8a460f65237d1b1ca4defa227b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "1e7c335d9351258297a79568c99e1a344cb1cd8a460f65237d1b1ca4defa227b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Here he hesitated for a word, and I, although I knew nothing about the matter, helped him out with suggestions in the same rhetorical vein.",
      "output_sha256": "7deb08a8899528a244cb1a50e4ef419c496f0277a0a929a1507d1d7fcb73c38c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "7deb08a8899528a244cb1a50e4ef419c496f0277a0a929a1507d1d7fcb73c38c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Or a button-hook,” I said, “or a blunderbuss or a battering-ram or a piston-rod——”",
      "output_sha256": "1bb7d4eeb69239a880fc3e65fa92d42fcf70a0b403354d37465f7acb2b8ee828",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "1bb7d4eeb69239a880fc3e65fa92d42fcf70a0b403354d37465f7acb2b8ee828",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He resumed, refreshed with this assistance, “Or a curtain rod or a candle-stick, or a——”",
      "output_sha256": "48d80f1853fe80ac6afc693ec5713c349e3a6c959503236ea4c33b05598ecaf3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "48d80f1853fe80ac6afc693ec5713c349e3a6c959503236ea4c33b05598ecaf3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Cow-catcher,” I suggested eagerly, and we continued in this ecstatic duet for some time.",
      "output_sha256": "d223b4baf74a5df96d8a3fd5b9e481d025a36b88748067ad2c204750c29f2f13",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "d223b4baf74a5df96d8a3fd5b9e481d025a36b88748067ad2c204750c29f2f13",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Then I asked him what it was all about, and he told me.",
      "output_sha256": "05dafb4b9cb4aefceda81eb249eef5ae2690c0de17fc8655e794475469d19f5e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "05dafb4b9cb4aefceda81eb249eef5ae2690c0de17fc8655e794475469d19f5e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He explained the thing eloquently and at length.",
      "output_sha256": "47702983f0ae2f273d578284d224d96368669ac8bb8c3aa222cd16bd857bd6f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "47702983f0ae2f273d578284d224d96368669ac8bb8c3aa222cd16bd857bd6f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“The amusing part,” he noted, “is that this concept isn’t actually new.",
      "output_sha256": "405cdc6845e235c133774d320472fa142634cd4e2d40588e5b1ff6b5fc9baacf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.491818,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cfa8641646dacc5b58f21ce63fae0b585a02524c59ffc35941b9bd46b6af1b9e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "405cdc6845e235c133774d320472fa142634cd4e2d40588e5b1ff6b5fc9baacf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It’s been talked about ever since I was a boy, and long before.",
      "output_sha256": "27b2eaf749c5eead71f31aa906eab48b5b39778b6579cea2566ac5a0acaf944b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "27b2eaf749c5eead71f31aa906eab48b5b39778b6579cea2566ac5a0acaf944b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There’s always been speculation about how to shave without a razor, but none of those ideas ever materialized, and I doubt this one will either.”",
      "output_sha256": "a5c0e2e0a1124996991baa05bed6a9cd920a2b5cc4c51737c29982ea801660c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.465808,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39,
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d1e0f9db09af3d6371187733bb706e804672edb9cb642214334cff872029d651",
        "79e98daf4896281e0b195e8e7418aa91550b582828b7d7b17707e81d6c126c25"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a5c0e2e0a1124996991baa05bed6a9cd920a2b5cc4c51737c29982ea801660c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Well,” I responded, slowly rising from the chair while trying to put my coat on inside out, “I can’t speak to the validity of your new shaving method.",
      "output_sha256": "7366f7080124c4714cdda5223d0103464e9ceb1047dfee4edcea2043afb7818e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.533681,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "200efac7bda91056d2c4451347986e87ce84052ffa10ac17a7ceedcbc3bffe19"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7366f7080124c4714cdda5223d0103464e9ceb1047dfee4edcea2043afb7818e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Shaving, while significant, is a rather trivial matter in the grand scheme of things.",
      "output_sha256": "7d3523a9960f55b526653e629f94cf5889141934b4e71ea9f80e28abe30d97d2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": 0.387619,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1fe56d001d25e0392f3f73441e4aa59697694a18397242a805ad31d2b33297a8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7d3523a9960f55b526653e629f94cf5889141934b4e71ea9f80e28abe30d97d2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But what you say reminds me in some dark and dreamy fashion of something else.",
      "output_sha256": "182ff2edc71a283c8470e2a4aab9a38a166b73ae51dcdc31e39226c4e86b23b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "182ff2edc71a283c8470e2a4aab9a38a166b73ae51dcdc31e39226c4e86b23b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I recall it especially when you tell me, with such evident experience and sincerity, that the new shaving is not really new.",
      "output_sha256": "6a44ee3f677b5d912bc2fc966677da3257774af4f73ac7aa1d45dde2e9cc9a86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a44ee3f677b5d912bc2fc966677da3257774af4f73ac7aa1d45dde2e9cc9a86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My friend, the human race is always trying this dodge of making everything entirely easy; but the difficulty which it shifts off one thing it shifts on to another.",
      "output_sha256": "8a40591a66043019876d7d73c8d7a94ce5f9e953f9304eb7de6713989da05c3e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a40591a66043019876d7d73c8d7a94ce5f9e953f9304eb7de6713989da05c3e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I continued, “If one person manages to avoid the labor of preparing for a shave, then surely another must bear the burden of creating an alternative for that process.",
      "output_sha256": "54c536f915eb0aa2aceaf570200d242da44def7ccd67fd5e0d5f3653fdbca61f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.355957,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3bb2631fc2e02ba0304d4a916907d8abfbc8efb9a82a239b246b9f7070f3c6e5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_ai_sha256": "54c536f915eb0aa2aceaf570200d242da44def7ccd67fd5e0d5f3653fdbca61f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        49
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It would be nice if we could be shaved without troubling anybody.",
      "output_sha256": "151b332019fed83a4b14bd8d9dc2dffde2eff74d12e0fdad7fe4ac82dcfd5cf9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "151b332019fed83a4b14bd8d9dc2dffde2eff74d12e0fdad7fe4ac82dcfd5cf9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It would be nicer still if we could go unshaved without annoying anybody—",
      "output_sha256": "133170423df396617742c93401332cf801e128ca8a8a72163570a45194f2b429",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "133170423df396617742c93401332cf801e128ca8a8a72163570a45194f2b429",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“‘But, O wise friend, chief Barber of the Strand, Brother, nor you nor I have made the world.’",
      "output_sha256": "ae4044fd99be9334b080e61c22b2d82a0724b3d1f34d384cdd2f450603dfddca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae4044fd99be9334b080e61c22b2d82a0724b3d1f34d384cdd2f450603dfddca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Whoever designed it—presumably someone wiser and better than ourselves—did so under peculiar constraints and with a blend of pleasure and pain.",
      "output_sha256": "0fedf0580a7b4300cd0c55bda64ae780199ba76b54b047b1c6ea5f5d13187f7c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.550932,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a31bb26afb04fe320dcbb1391bf7b3adf945561877ec1b05cd553baa92b6157e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0fedf0580a7b4300cd0c55bda64ae780199ba76b54b047b1c6ea5f5d13187f7c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“In the first and darkest of its books it is fiercely written that a man shall not eat his cake and have it; and though all men talked until the stars were old it would still be true that a man who has lost his razor could not shave with it.",
      "output_sha256": "079616b4c2300a516777ba13f692ffb4085114cd38ebc610895d50c8fb0835b6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "079616b4c2300a516777ba13f692ffb4085114cd38ebc610895d50c8fb0835b6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Periodically, people rise with notions of new solutions and proclaim that everything can be achieved without sacrifice, that what is deemed bad is actually good if only one is enlightened, and that the distinction between being shaved and unshaved is merely a matter of perspective.",
      "output_sha256": "52bbadfd049deee757496355dc986dd50aef1e66cdeb5fe798c5eecde738d3e3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.483454,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dc98cb14efb699a95c3e443344350d1409d8439c4421623ef2b4b9aa8a588062"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_ai_sha256": "52bbadfd049deee757496355dc986dd50aef1e66cdeb5fe798c5eecde738d3e3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The difference, they say, is only a difference of degree; everything is evolutionary and relative.",
      "output_sha256": "f4664c83be077ac8c4526ab66898510d73e7d5ee40d8fb68d93b4a6f7bbc4067",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "f4664c83be077ac8c4526ab66898510d73e7d5ee40d8fb68d93b4a6f7bbc4067",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Shavedness is immanent in man.",
      "output_sha256": "ae035d0b8c86d93d6e50e2bfa70a45f822a4a3e065bdba6a83614c13adad6853",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae035d0b8c86d93d6e50e2bfa70a45f822a4a3e065bdba6a83614c13adad6853",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Every ten-penny nail is a Potential Razor.",
      "output_sha256": "f1372c00393e8895b43f434dae02d250acbe96909a7668698aa5b4b05909da0b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "f1372c00393e8895b43f434dae02d250acbe96909a7668698aa5b4b05909da0b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Those superstitious individuals of the past may have viewed facial hair as a definitive trait, but enlightened thinkers now argue that it is merely an absence of something else.",
      "output_sha256": "42302dc5008efbaff4cbdc5482fe1c2a58b6927b3881ea3356cd480c54c2306f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.272519,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56,
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f70b2ee757f7726957685ccef58491357987e39ebda556cbd5a22f0e1bd64d86",
        "9d9425a0ad81954c3dab5f460e8b4921971cb410a2d45ff8a61ab6aa11007782"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_ai_sha256": "42302dc5008efbaff4cbdc5482fe1c2a58b6927b3881ea3356cd480c54c2306f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Bristles are merely negative.",
      "output_sha256": "6136e16083f2caf12891b1247961c3e9c3c79ea79807a65ba7bb4d28c15fa958",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "6136e16083f2caf12891b1247961c3e9c3c79ea79807a65ba7bb4d28c15fa958",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are a Shadow where Shaving should be.",
      "output_sha256": "dd724861e572ba67f014a8f962a448035241b9d029da70f2a69a73dc727ef72a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd724861e572ba67f014a8f962a448035241b9d029da70f2a69a73dc727ef72a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "“Life continues on its course, and I’m sure there’s meaning in it all.",
      "output_sha256": "3731c035267fdea728376e671a8047cf67dd59f0ec5156f0558c43245860734d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": 0.279692,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8fa0f55a2077280622113aa4436c60cb7a51b636040938a78fe308bac88a1549"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3731c035267fdea728376e671a8047cf67dd59f0ec5156f0558c43245860734d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "But a child embodies the Kingdom of God, and the moment you attempt to kiss a baby, they will know whether or not you are clean-shaven.",
      "output_sha256": "44c0c6af8c3e0e1c1b019ea924edf3b9cd5784a6c1e340f3763751290ecca162",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.692308,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba01b3e161543e5a37eed23e3acfb735db8e9051c262f5c097b30a39ed59b135"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_ai_sha256": "44c0c6af8c3e0e1c1b019ea924edf3b9cd5784a6c1e340f3763751290ecca162",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps I am mixing up being shaved and being saved; my democratic sympathies have always led me to drop my ‘h’s.’ In another moment I may suggest that goats represent the lost because goats have long beards.",
      "output_sha256": "335c05b11a602ecf5d737349680bb0c14af3b163cd3fd2ca7cb536914c02a100",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "335c05b11a602ecf5d737349680bb0c14af3b163cd3fd2ca7cb536914c02a100",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "This is becoming overly metaphorical.",
      "output_sha256": "71c9b48969751460986fb20574fae040076bbf2490459193f2d78cdaa40f9693",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.380303,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        63
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b2e9fd7457100ccdb14c50e5467abe32023010692428e1d59ea498037e960efc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_ai_sha256": "71c9b48969751460986fb20574fae040076bbf2490459193f2d78cdaa40f9693",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "“Nevertheless,” I added, as I paid the bill, “I have really been profoundly interested in what you told me about the New Shaving.",
      "output_sha256": "ed5d7cf6e1f0b5e73cdc4f1f52d967fe893f3f366a1ba1334ab636230f85d061",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 64,
      "source_human_sha256": "ed5d7cf6e1f0b5e73cdc4f1f52d967fe893f3f366a1ba1334ab636230f85d061",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Have you ever heard of a thing called the New theology?”",
      "output_sha256": "04bbf52856e84e78a76207241abdae1efc229a2e2fbd909cb344a5a0f7a08bea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 65,
      "source_human_sha256": "04bbf52856e84e78a76207241abdae1efc229a2e2fbd909cb344a5a0f7a08bea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He smiled and said that he had not.",
      "output_sha256": "ba96025948443dee4b5c7e4e6fca6d627d79d68f6ec9e27deeaa635de5201a35",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
